    "The AFM tip is parked above the specimen. Coarse approach, nanoscanning and calibrated tip-sample interactions are not implemented by this alignment repair.",
    "Browser Photo captures are inspection samples, not converged offline renders.",
    "Cables retain prescribed visual deformation without contact or elastic dynamics. The separate native contact benchmark uses a parallel gripper without an articulated arm."
